# Complete Production Responsive UI/UX Audit — StayEaze Frontend

Full-stack audit of **68 feature pages**, **20 common components**, **5 layout components**, and **47 UI primitives** across breakpoints 320px–1920px.

---

## P0 — Critical / Broken

### 1. `scrollbar-thin` class is not a valid Tailwind utility
**Files**: [AppLayout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/components/layout/AppLayout.tsx#L91), [VisitorsPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/features/visitors/VisitorsPage.tsx#L644), [PropertySwitcher.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/components/layout/PropertySwitcher.tsx#L247), [RaiseSupportTicketModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/components/support/RaiseSupportTicketModal.tsx)

`scrollbar-thin` is not a built-in Tailwind class. No plugin or custom utility is defined in [index.css](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/index.css) for this. The class does nothing. Either add the `scrollbar-thin` utility via CSS (`scrollbar-width: thin`) or remove the class.

**Fix**: Add to `index.css` `@layer utilities`:
```css
.scrollbar-thin {
  scrollbar-width: thin; /* Firefox */
}
.scrollbar-thin::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
}
```

