### 2. `StatCard` icon has conflicting size classes
**File**: [StatCard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/components/common/StatCard.tsx#L46)

```tsx
<Icon className="h-5.5 w-5.5 h-6 w-6" />
```
`h-5.5 w-5.5` is not a valid default Tailwind class. Followed immediately by `h-6 w-6`, the last one wins (in compiled output), but `h-5.5` generates no CSS. This is a bug — icon size should be intentional.

**Fix**: Use `h-6 w-6` or `h-5 w-5` — pick one.

