### 7. PropertySwitcher trigger button too narrow on 320px
**File**: [PropertySwitcher.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/components/layout/PropertySwitcher.tsx#L122)

The trigger uses `max-w-[130px] xs:max-w-[180px]` — but `xs` is not a default Tailwind breakpoint. It does nothing. At 320px, the button is capped at 130px and text is truncated to near-illegibility ("All P...").

**Fix**: Remove the non-existent `xs:` modifier. Use `max-w-[160px] sm:max-w-[240px] md:max-w-[280px]`.

