### 8. Charts don't resize properly on mobile in DashboardPage
**File**: [DashboardPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/features/dashboard/DashboardPage.tsx)

`ResponsiveContainer` from Recharts requires a parent with explicit width. The dashboard cards use `Card` → `CardContent` → `ResponsiveContainer`. At 320px, the chart overflows its card because no `min-h-0` or `overflow-hidden` is set on the parent.

**Fix**: Add `overflow-hidden` to all chart-containing `CardContent` elements and set `min-h-0` on flex parents.

