### 9. DataTable search bar uses `shrink-0` at full width on mobile — blocks filter visibility
**File**: [DataTable.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/components/common/DataTable.tsx#L562)

Search bar: `w-full sm:w-64 md:w-72 lg:w-80 shrink-0`. At mobile (`w-full`), it takes the entire row. Filters are pushed below. With `flex-wrap`, this stacks correctly, but the Export/Columns buttons are also `shrink-0` and appear on a third row. At 320px, the toolbar takes ~160px of vertical space before any data is visible.

**Fix**: On mobile, collapse the search into a single expandable icon. Or reduce toolbar density by hiding Export/Columns behind a single "⋯" overflow menu on mobile.

