### 12. CheckInsPage form dialog — too many fields for mobile viewport
**File**: [CheckInsPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/features/check-in/CheckInsPage.tsx)

