### 18. Inconsistent modal border/shadow patterns
**Across all files**

Three border patterns found in DialogContent:
1. `border-border/80` — semi-transparent theme border
2. `border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800` — explicit solid border
3. `border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800` (no opacity)

These look nearly identical in light mode but differ subtly in dark mode.

**Fix**: Standardize to `border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800`.

