### 19. Print stylesheet hides all content except QR poster
**File**: [index.css](file:///c:/Users/gandh/OneDrive/Desktop/StayEaze/stayeaze-web/src/index.css#L159-L161)

```css
body * { visibility: hidden !important; }
```
This makes ALL print output invisible unless the QR poster is present. If a user tries to print a billing page or report, they get a blank page.

**Fix**: Scope the `visibility: hidden` rule inside a `.print-qr-only` class applied dynamically only when printing the QR poster, not globally.

