### 24. Touch target sizes on some icon-only buttons
**Files**: Various RowActions, sort buttons in DataTable headers

Several interactive elements have `h-8 w-8` touch targets (32px). Apple HIG and WCAG recommend minimum 44px × 44px for touch targets.

