## Responsive Behavior Summary by Breakpoint

| Breakpoint | Key Issues |
|---|---|
| **320px** | PropertySwitcher text clipped, toolbar 3-row stacking, charts overflow, tab overflow, excessive bottom padding |
| **375px** | Same as 320px but slightly less severe |
| **390–430px** | Phablet range — PageHeader buttons wrap awkwardly, 2-col stat grids are cramped |
| **480px** | Transition zone — not quite `sm` (640px), so many elements still use mobile layout but have more space than needed |
| **768px** | `md` breakpoint — MobileBottomNav hides, tables switch to desktop view. Clean transition. |
| **1024px** | `lg` breakpoint — sidebar shows. Desktop layout kicks in. Generally good. |
| **1280–1440px** | Sweet spot — all layouts work well |
| **1920px** | `max-w-[1600px]` caps content, leaving margins. Acceptable. |

